    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "DPO works by leveraging a particular parameterization of the reward model, which enables the extraction of the optimal policy in closed form. This is achieved through a <strong>reparameterization</strong> of the reward model, allowing for the optimization of the policy directly. The DPO update increases the relative log probability of preferred to dispreferred responses, while incorporating a dynamic importance weight to prevent model degeneration.",
