    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Experiments show that DPO can fine-tune language models to align with human preferences as well as or better than existing methods, including PPO-based RLHF. DPO achieves a better reward-KL frontier, indicating more efficient optimization, and is more robust to changes in the sampling temperature. Additionally, DPO converges to its best performance relatively quickly and generalizes well to new input distributions.",
